  message: "SATISFIED by PR #1288 (dev 5a4f40c2fa + 42e0b78d85). Both sink match sites (structural and DDG propagators) now pass io_target_kinds=call_site_target_kinds(meta), as the source sites did.\n\nBEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE, the item's own repro re-run on merged dev 42e0b78d85 (Go file, one statement io.WriteString(os.Stderr, os.Getenv(\"API_KEY\"))): host_secret -> logging VIOLATED rc 1, 1 flow, sink_primitives [io.WriteString] (was CONFIRMED, 0 flows); host_secret -> host_fs CONFIRMED (was VIOLATED). io-boundaries: logging io.WriteString. Taint and io-boundaries now give this call site one answer.\n\nTESTS: core test_sink_match_reads_the_writer.py drives BOTH propagators with the shipped go catalogue (DDG arm given a real def-use edge so it reaches the sink; red before the fix: every stamp returned the fallback zone). lang-mainstream test_go_taint_sink_follows_the_writer.py: io-boundaries and verify-claims name the same zone for os.Stderr / os.Create / cmd.StdinPipe().\n\nA/B, 13 repos (7 go, 3 c, 3 haskell), ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/totar_09282026/RESULT.md: 0 verdicts changed; 5 sink sites moved zone, all read back from source -- 4 correct (beads + 2 podman file writes logging -> host_fs; prometheus http.ResponseWriter host_fs -> network), 1 better but not exact (podman net.DialTimeout(\"unix\") logging -> network; exact is ipc -> filed WI-potog).\n\nSCOPE OF THE CLAIM. The wiring covers every target-kind-gated sink row (go io.WriteString / fmt.Fprint* / os.File.Write* / bufio.Writer.Write*, c/cpp unistd.write + sys/socket send*, haskell hPut*/hPrint). Measured on Go only: the c and haskell cohort had no stamped writer a flow reaches (haproxy 2 send edges stamped pipe, no flow; redis/tmate/shellcheck/xmonad/hadolint 0), so those languages are UNMEASURED on a corpus, not shown clean. Python typing.TextIO.write is gated but python stamps no io_target_kind.\n\nRESIDUALS FILED: WI-jufub (go os.Stdout/os.Stderr and java System.out/err are still ipc_send attribute rows -- WI-dutah's sweep missed them; the repro still reports host_secret -> ipc VIOLATED through the os.Stderr reference), WI-potog (go unix-family sockets stamp net_stream)."  # a4ae
